# Xiaomi's fingerprint uinput node also exposes Linux BTN_C. Generic.kl maps
# that scan code to BUTTON_C, causing AOSP to classify the built-in device as
# a connected game controller. Keep its normal virtual keys and intentionally
# leave BTN_C unmapped; the fingerprint AIDL HAL reports UDFPS events itself.
key 102   MOVE_HOME   VIRTUAL
key 116   POWER       WAKE
key 139   MENU        VIRTUAL
key 158   BACK        VIRTUAL
